{%- comment -%}
  NURVA PERFORMANCE — clean home page section.

  Online Store -> Themes -> Edit code -> Sections -> Add a new section,
  name it  nurva-home  (Shopify adds the .liquid), paste this in, Save.
  Then Customize -> Add section -> Nurva home.

  No product Liquid on this page at all -- the homepage doesn't sell
  directly, it just shows a hero image and a product photo, each with a
  Buy Now button that links to your product page. Set the hero image,
  the buy-section image, and the product page link from the theme
  Customizer (this section's block/section settings) -- no code editing
  needed for those. Styles are scoped under .nurva and cannot affect
  the rest of your theme.
{%- endcomment -%}

